#: src/core/portfolio/ui/portfolio-translations.ts:66
msgid "At Kairos, I moved from building features to helping the whole product move forward: React, microfrontends, and microservices for a retail platform that needs to grow without losing speed."
msgstr "En Kairos pasé de construir funcionalidades a ayudar a que todo el producto avance: React, microfrontends y microservicios en una plataforma retail que necesita crecer sin perder velocidad."

#: src/core/portfolio/ui/portfolio-translations.ts:78
msgid "At NEORIS, I worked on GENIAC, an “office as a service” platform backed by Grant Thornton to digitize back-office processes: accounting, HR, and business management. I grew from Full Stack to Senior Front-end Developer and helped define practices to improve performance, quality, and maintainability."
msgstr "En NEORIS trabajé en GENIAC, una plataforma de “office as a service” impulsada por Grant Thornton para digitalizar procesos de back-office: contabilidad, RRHH y gestión empresarial. Evolucioné de Full Stack a Senior Front-end Developer y ayudé a definir prácticas para mejorar rendimiento, calidad y mantenibilidad."

